{\"safety_factor\": 4.41}}\n【校验器反馈】参考 sigma_max=66.67 MPa，safety_factor=235/66.67=3.525，草案 4.41 相对偏差 25.1%，超出 8% 容差。\n示例2 回答：{\"world_state\": {\"safety_factor\": 3.525, \"fos_gate\": \"pass\"}, \"derivation\": {\"safety_factor\": \"(235)/(66.67)\"}, \"correction\": {\"changed\": true, \"error_type\": \"numeric_hallucination\", \"corrections\": [{\"field\": \"safety_factor\", \"draft\": 4.41, \"reference\": 3.525, \"rel_err\": 0.251}], \"explanation\": \"草案 4.41 与求解器参考值 3.525 偏差 25.1%，超 8% 容差，按参考值更正。\"}, \"verification\": {\"source\": \"verifier_L2\", \"rel_tol\": 0.08, \"resolved\": true}}", "context": [], "prompt": "【场景】tols=[0.07,0.07,0.035,0.035,0.02] mm，upper_dev=0.25 mm，lower_dev=0.0 mm。\n计算目标：尺寸链闭环，最坏情况半宽=各环公差半宽之和，RSS 半宽=各环公差半宽平方和开根号。\n只输出一个 JSON，顶层键为 world_state，其中必须逐项给出这些字段：closed_loop_rss_halfwidth_mm, closed_loop_worstcase_halfwidth_mm, fit_clearance_mm。\n再在顶层给出 derivation：对上述每个数值字段，用字符串写出**代入算式**，算式里只能出现上面给出的数值、该定律自身的常数（8、1000、12、π）与本题已算出的中间量；乘积由校验器现算，符号名与数值必须取自上面的题面，禁止代入题面没有的数或记忆中的默认参数；只写符号式不代数值不算完成。每个数值仍请同时填入 world_state 对应字段，保留 4 位有效数字。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 448, "tags": ["derivation", "tolerance", "solver-gold"], "gold": {"answer": "{\"world_state\": {\"closed_loop_worstcase_halfwidth_mm\": 0.23, \"closed_loop_rss_halfwidth_mm\": 0.1125, \"fit_clearance_mm\": 0.25}, \"derivation\": {\"closed_loop_worstcase_halfwidth_mm\": \"(0.07)+(0.07)+(0.035)+(0.035)+(0.02)\", \"closed_loop_rss_halfwidth_mm\": \"sqrt((0.07)^2+(0.07)^2+(0.035)^2+(0.035)^2+(0.02)^2)\", \"fit_clearance_mm\": \"(0.25)-(0)\"}}", "derivation": "gold=wm_verifier.recompute(task=tolerance) 原样派生，无人工填写；tol_rel=0.03（medium），求解器默认 0.08"}, "criteria": [{"type": "json_object", "key": "json_shape", "weight": 1, "required_keys": ["world_state", "derivation"]}, {"type": "derivation_verified", "key": "law_and_binding", "weight": 3, "scenario": {"task": "tolerance", "inputs": {"tols": [0.07, 0.07, 0.035, 0.035, 0.02], "upper_dev": 0.25, "lower_dev": 0.0}}, "tol_rel": 0.01}, {"type": "physics_invariant", "key": "invariants", "weight": 1, "scenario": {"task": "tolerance", "inputs": {"tols": [0.07, 0.07, 0.035, 0.035, 0.02], "upper_dev": 0.25, "lower_dev": 0.0}}}, {"type": "world_state_verified", "key": "reproduced_by_solver", "weight": 3, "scenario": {"task": "tolerance", "inputs": {"tols": [0.07, 0.07, 0.035, 0.035, 0.02], "upper_dev": 0.25, "lower_dev": 0.0}}, "tol_rel": 0.03, "must_compare": ["closed_loop_worstcase_halfwidth_mm", "closed_loop_rss_halfwidth_mm", "fit_clearance_mm"]}]}
{"id": "derivation-m09", "dimension": "derivation", "tier": "medium", "language": "zh", "system": "你是 Virtu 制造世界模型（World Model）。你的唯一职责：把制造场景换算成可被 CAD/CAE/CAM 工具链回灌验证的物理量预测。\n\n【输出铁律】\n1. 只输出一个 JSON 对象：首字符必须是 {，末字符必须是 }。禁止解释、禁止 Markdown 围栏、禁止前后缀文字。\n2. 顶层键只能是 world_state（非法输入时该值为 null）。禁止出现 tool、arguments、name、action、function 等键——你不是工具调用器，不要输出调用指令。\n3. 每个数值必须能由题面参数直接算出：键名带单位后缀（_mm3、_mm、_g、_um、_mm3_per_min、_z_mm），保留 3 位有效数字。\n4. 参数不足时不得编造，必须报错：{\"world_state\": null, \"invalid\": true, \"reason\": \"缺少<具体参数名>\"}。\n\n【领域规则】\nA. 草案更正：题面若同时给【草案】与【校验器反馈】，一律以反馈中的参考值为准覆盖草案，并在 correction 字段给出 {changed, error_type, corrections:[{field,draft,reference,rel_err}], explanation}；若草案与参考在 8% 容差内一致，则 changed=false 并原样保留，严禁无依据改动。\nB. 陌生环境：题面给出材料/机床物性表（密度、弹性模量、切削系数等）时，必须用表中数值代入公式，禁止使用记忆中的默认值。\nC. 设计任务：额外输出 design 字段（features 列表 + dimensions_mm），几何质量属性放 world_state 的 mass_props。\nD. 判定闸门：safety_factor >= 1.5 记 fos_gate=\"pass\" 否则 \"fail\"；材料去除类必须 delta_volume_mm3 < 0 且 volume_conservation 如实标注；刀轨判定 autodiff 取 red（过切）/ yellow（风险）/ green（合格）。\nE. 示例仅供模仿\"输出结构\"，示例中的任何数字都绝不可以照抄进答案；必须逐项用本题给定参数重新计算。\nF. 推导必须写明：对 world_state 里每个数值字段，在顶层 derivation 给出该字段的**代入算式**（字符串），\n   算式里只允许出现 ①题面给出的数值 ②该定律自身的常数（如 8、1000、12、π）③本题已算出的中间量。\n   乘积由校验器现算——你的职责是选对定律、把每个符号绑到题面对应的那个数上，不是手算乘法。\n   算式里出现题面没有的数（例如把默认刀尖半径 1.0 代进题面给的 r_eps=0.8）一律判为绑定错误；\n   只写符号式不代数字（\"1000*f^2/(8*r_eps)\"）判为未绑定。\n\n【输出示例（严格模仿其形态）】\n示例1 用户：【场景】铣削去除材料：毛坯 200×150×50 mm，加工后工件 200×150×46 mm，钢密度 7.85 g/cm3。\n示例1 回答：{\"world_state\": {\"material_removed_mm3\": 120000, \"delta_volume_mm3\": -120000, \"resulting_mass_g\": 10833, \"volume_conservation\": \"pass\"}, \"derivation\": {\"material_removed_mm3\": \"(200)*(150)*(50-(46))\", \"delta_volume_mm3\": \"-((200)*(150)*(50-(46)))\", \"resulting_mass_g\": \"(200)*(150)*(50)*(0.00785)-((200)*(150)*(50-(46)))*(0.00785)\"}, \"verification\": {\"source\": \"volume_formula\", \"resolved\": true}}\n示例2 用户：【场景】梁受载：矩形截面 b=20 mm、h=30 mm，跨距 L=400 mm，集中载荷 F=8 kN，材料许用应力 235 MPa。\n【草案】{\"world_state\": {\"safety_factor\": 4.41}}\n【校验器反馈】参考 sigma_max=66.67 MPa，safety_factor=235/66.67=3.525，草案 4.41 相对偏差 25.1%，超出 8% 容差。\n示例2 回答：{\"world_state\": {\"safety_factor\": 3.525, \"fos_gate\": \"pass\"}, \"derivation\": {\"safety_factor\": \"(235)/(66.67)\"}, \"correction\": {\"changed\": true, \"error_type\": \"numeric_hallucination\", \"corrections\": [{\"field\": \"safety_factor\", \"draft\": 4.41, \"reference\": 3.525, \"rel_err\": 0.251}], \"explanation\": \"草案 4.41 与求解器参考值 3.525 偏差 25.1%，超 8% 容差，按参考值更正。\"}, \"verification\": {\"source\": \"verifier_L2\", \"rel_tol\": 0.08, \"resolved\": true}}", "context": [], "prompt": "【场景】r_out=50.0 mm，r_bore=20.0 mm，t=10.0 mm，n_holes=6 个，r_hole=5.0 mm，rho=0.00785 g/mm3。\n计算目标：法兰盘质量，体积=pi*(r_out^2-r_bore^2)*t - n_holes*pi*r_hole^2*t。\n只输出一个 JSON，顶层键为 world_state，其中必须逐项给出这些字段：mass_g, mass_kg, volume_mm3。\n再在顶层给出 derivation：对上述每个数值字段，用字符串写出**代入算式**，算式里只能出现上面给出的数值、该定律自身的常数（8、1000、12、π）与本题已算出的中间量；乘积由校验器现算，符号名与数值必须取自上面的题面，禁止代入题面没有的数或记忆中的默认参数；只写符号式不代数值不算完成。每个数值仍请同时填入 world_state 对应字段，保留 4 位有效数字。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 448, "tags": ["derivation", "design", "solver-gold"], "gold": {"answer": "{\"world_state\": {\"volume_mm3\": 61260.0, \"mass_g\": 480.9, \"mass_kg\": 0.4809}, \"derivation\": {\"volume_mm3\": \"pi*((50)^2-(20)^2)*(10)-(6)*pi*(5)^2*(10)\", \"mass_g\": \"(61261.056745000962)*(0.00785)\", \"mass_kg\": \"(480.899295448258)/1000\"}}", "derivation": "gold=wm_verifier.recompute(task=design) 原样派生，无人工填写；tol_rel=0.03（medium），求解器默认 0.08"}, "criteria": [{"type": "json_object", "key": "json_shape", "weight": 1, "required_keys": ["world_state", "derivation"]}, {"type": "derivation_verified", "key": "law_and_binding", "weight": 3, "scenario": {"task": "design", "inputs": {"r_out": 50.0, "r_bore": 20.0, "t": 10.0, "n_holes": 6, "r_hole": 5.0, "rho": 0.00785}}, "tol_rel": 0.01}, {"type": "physics_invariant", "key": "invariants", "weight": 1, "scenario": {"task": "design", "inputs": {"r_out": 50.0, "r_bore": 20.0, "t": 10.0, "n_holes": 6, "r_hole": 5.0, "rho": 0.00785}}}, {"type": "world_state_verified", "key": "reproduced_by_solver", "weight": 3, "scenario": {"task": "design", "inputs": {"r_out": 50.0, "r_bore": 20.0, "t": 10.0, "n_holes": 6, "r_hole": 5.0, "rho": 0.00785}}, "tol_rel": 0.03, "must_compare": ["volume_mm3", "mass_g", "mass_kg"]}]}
